		"description": "Restful Booker API – QA Automation Practice\r\nA Postman collection built to practice and demonstrate API testing skills using the Restful Booker playground API. Covers full CRUD operations (GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE) on the /booking endpoint, plus token-based authentication via /auth. Each request includes automated tests validating status codes, response structure, and data integrity. The token generated in the Auth request is stored as an environment variable and reused across protected endpoints (PUT/DELETE) to simulate a realistic authenticated workflow.",
